# Libsyn

> Libsyn is a podcast hosting, distribution, monetization, and analytics platform for creators, brands, podcast networks, and enterprise teams.



## What Is Libsyn?

Libsyn, short for Liberated Syndication, is one of the original podcast hosting platforms. Founded in 2004, Libsyn helps podcasters host audio and video files, generate podcast RSS feeds, distribute episodes to major listening apps, track performance with IAB-certified analytics, and monetize shows through advertising and paid subscriptions.

Libsyn is built for podcasters who want to own their show, control their RSS feed, manage audience data, and grow without needing to migrate to another host as their podcast becomes larger. 

