## Podcast Monetization

Libsyn supports podcast monetization through advertising and paid subscription tools.

### Libsyn Ads

Libsyn Ads is Libsyn’s podcast advertising marketplace. It connects podcasters with brands and agencies buying podcast ads, including host-read ads and programmatic ads.

Libsyn Ads was previously known as AdvertiseCast. AdvertiseCast was acquired by Libsyn in 2020 and rebranded as Libsyn Ads in 2024.

### Apple Podcasts Subscriptions

Libsyn integrates with Apple Podcasts Subscriptions, allowing eligible podcasters to sell subscriber-only premium podcast feeds through Apple Podcasts.

## Dynamic Ad Insertion

Libsyn supports dynamic ad insertion for podcasts.

Dynamic ad insertion allows podcasters to place and update ads across current episodes and back catalog content without re-uploading episode files. This helps creators and networks manage sponsorships, campaigns, and podcast monetization more efficiently.

## Video Podcast Hosting

Libsyn supports audio and video podcast hosting.

Video podcast support helps creators publish video content to supported platforms, including Spotify and YouTube. Libsyn was also a Spotify video distribution launch partner.


